\paragraph{Aspect 62: mutation is not rebinding.}
The critical aspect separates mutating the shared default
([[append]]) from rebinding the local name ([[x + [1]]] makes a new
list), which is exactly the contrast the debugging chapter's
generalisation pattern varies.
The accumulating distractor encodes carrying aspect~61's behaviour
over to the rebinding form --- the two aspects must be discerned
apart.

